pkg:Evidence_v1_21_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.21.0 (STORY-9 closed, STORY-10 filed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user pasted the actual rendered sidebar/menu content, showing full paragraphs used as menu items. Investigated the real rendering code rather than assuming a template bug -- confirmed renderExplorer() correctly renders only the short field; root cause was in this session's own STORY-1 data, where short had been built as a 22-word truncated sentence fragment rather than a genuine title. Rewrote all 18 short fields as real short titles and patched them into the live HTML via targeted replacement (preserving all prior cleanup work), confirmed exactly 18 replacements applied, re-verified via real Playwright and a fresh screenshot. User also asked whether the page's own agents work in parallel with proper failure-communication. Investigated the real orchestration code directly: confirmed the 11-agent pipeline is genuinely sequential, with at least some sequencing reflecting a real, disclosed data dependency (Grooming and Lineage Compose both consume Intent's own repaired output); separately confirmed a real failure-reason-then-retry pattern already exists (withOneAutoFix) but only for 2 of 11 stages. Filed as STORY-10, genuinely not started -- the real first task is dependency mapping across all 11 stages, not a naive parallelization that risks breaking real data flow. Re-verified: pipeline order (39 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "364e494f957280e6d018dba4058ee80aeb30ba780fd63fde7c0b1b8ed382645c"^^xsd:string .
